    "biography": "<h2>Wizard - Illusionist — Build Guide</h2>\n<p><em>Core Rulebook v3 Alpha 3, Appendix C. This Hero is built at Level 1 with no Ancestry — pick one, rename the Hero, and adjust anything you like.</em></p>\n<h3>Stats at Level 10</h3>\n<p><strong>MIT</strong> 4 · <strong>DEX</strong> 5 · <strong>AWR</strong> 7 · <strong>RSN</strong> 7 · <strong>PRS</strong> 4 · <strong>LUK</strong> 4</p>\n<h3>Perks by Level</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>1st:</strong> Bookworm, Extrovert <em>(already on this sheet)</em></li>\n<li><strong>3rd:</strong> Impersonator</li>\n<li><strong>5th:</strong> Sage</li>\n<li><strong>7th:</strong> Secret of Mana</li>\n<li><strong>9th:</strong> <em>(blank in the book)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Spells</h3><p>Color, Fear, Mirage, Shade; get Amplify, Blink, Confuse, and Morph later</p>\n<p><em>Book note: one Perk level is blank in the book.</em></p>",
